# tests/pins/outputs.sha256 -- sha256 of what the quick checks build from this
# repository's own sources, so a change that should not alter generated code
# can show that it does not.  Paths are relative to build-out/.  None depends
# on where the checkout lives (checked in two checkouts).  When a change is
# meant to alter one of them, update its line in the same commit and say why.
#   seed-cc/seed-cc, seed-cc/seed-ar   check 04 (seed Forth builds the driver)
#   stage-a/cc-out-v1                  check 07 (M2-Planet compiled by the Forth compiler)
#   amd64-runner, k1-direct/k1         check 08 (the K1 recipe runner and K1)
